    "description": "The Hotel Room Hold API enables the temporary reservation of hotel rooms, allowing customers to secure accommodations for a specified period. Through this endpoint, users can hold selected rooms, ensuring availability while they complete their booking process. This feature is particularly useful for travelers or businesses planning trips who want to avoid last-minute unavailability. Typically utilized by hotel booking platforms or travel agencies, this API streamlines the reservation workflow, enhancing customer satisfaction and operational efficiency.",
